  "body_text": "You don't often get email from support@glassworkshounsell.co.uk. Learn why this is important\n\nHi Giles,\n\nI wanted to follow up specifically regarding the actuators or hydraulic cylinders used within your equipment.\n\nWe appreciate that established machinery manufacturers will usually already have actuator suppliers in place. We are not suggesting changing a supply arrangement that is working well.\n\nWhere GWH may be useful is as an:\n\nAlternative UK manufacturing source\n\nSecond-source supplier\n\nAdditional source when capacity is tight\n\nOption for bespoke or difficult actuator requirements\n\nManufacturing partner for new machinery or product programmes\n\nGWH's strength is in substantial engineered components and assemblies, combining machining, fabrication, welding, assembly and inspection capability.\n\nWe are particularly interested in repeat actuator requirements where dependable quality and delivery are more important than simply finding the lowest-cost supplier.\n\nIf you have an actuator family that may be suitable for alternative sourcing, we would be very happy to review the requirement with your purchasing or engineering team.\n\nWould there be a suitable actuator or cylinder requirement for us to look at initially?\n\nKind Regards,\n\nDaniel\n\nE: support@glassworkshounsell.co.uk\n\nP: 01384 437 366\n\nW: glassworkshounsell.co.uk\n\nPark Lane, Halesowen, West Midlands, B63 2QS\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive these emails you may unsubscribe",
